e-commute", "storyline": "Welcome to a city that has turned the morning commute into a lethal chain reaction.\nUnfortunately, today it's Archie's turn.\n\nA broken alarm clock was just the opening act. Now, Archie must face a city that has transformed into a massive, lethal Rube Goldberg machine\u2014where even the laws of physics are conspiring to ensure his failure.\n\n20 minutes to the meeting. It\u2019s a sprint against a meticulously designed gauntlet of \"Accidental Malice.\" Falling AC units, rogue taxis, and erupting manholes aren\u2019t just obstacles; they are part of a grand, absurd chain reaction designed to physically dismantle poor Archie.", "summary": "\"20 mins to the meeting, or you\u2019re Dead Before Work!\" It's Archie's unluckiest day. From broken alarms to a city that\u2019s literally out to get him. Sprint through physics-based chaos, dodge cosmic-level bad luck, and rack up gag points. Can you survive the world\u2019s most lethal commute?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dead-before-work-the-commute", "videos": [{"id": 193398, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "TkvHVD3Z0JY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TkvHVD3Z0JY", "title": "\u3010OFFICIAL TRAILER\u3011Dead Before Work: The Commute", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TkvHVD3Z0JY/sddefault.jpg"}]}